    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in the opponent's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), right after attacks by an enemy unit destroy an **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM** unit of yours. Pick 1 **ADEPTUS ARBITES**, **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS** or **ORDO HERETICUS** unit of yours no more than 6\" from the destroyed unit (not the destroyed unit itself).\n\nOnce the attacker finishes shooting, the chosen unit may shoot as though in your own [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), but only at that enemy unit, provided it is eligible as a target.",
